# No automatic commit or push

**Do not** commit or push after implementing changes unless the user explicitly asks in that turn.

This overrides any prior “always commit and push” habit for this repo. Leave the working tree dirty for the user to review.

Still follow git safety when a commit/push *is* requested: no force-push to main/master, no amending pushed commits unless explicitly requested, no secrets in commits, no interactive git flags.
